sequenceDiagram
  actor D as Developer
  participant M as Developer machine
  participant L as Log Hub server
  L-->>D: My API Keys → Install: one-liner with server URL and API key
  D->>M: run it in the repository root
  M->>L: npx downloads /static/artisyn-hooks-installer.tgz
  M->>M: write .artisyn/ (serverUrl, apiKey), enable the plugin in .claude/
  D->>M: work in Claude Code
  M->>M: hook records the session locally
  M->>L: end of each turn: upload with x-api-key
  L->>L: queue and ingest
  D->>L: open Log Hub in the browser
  L-->>D: session on the Home page
